| ShortSummary    = When Tom saves a human boy from a building which was on fire and gets featured on the news, he starts to act more like a washed-up celebrity than a friend and a hero, to his friends' annoyance. Later, Tom goes alone to clear up a landslide, but spends his time showing off instead of working, and clears up the landslide only with his friends' help. When the news crew arrives, however, he credits his friends as well, having learnt his lesson.
