| ShortSummary    = The friends visit a pyramid, when the Raccoon Robber steals numerous artefacts and a sceptre, unleashing a curse that destroys the pyramid and unleashes small creatures that will stop anyone from reversing the curse. The gang catches the Raccoon Robber and returns the sceptre to its stand, undoing the curse.
