| ShortSummary    = Tom's car breaks down when he tries racing against a driver in a sports car, and Ben repairs it. Ben also fills it with a liquid that makes it go faster, warning Tom not to use too much of it. Tom ignores Ben's warning, and uses multiple bottles of the liquid, and the car develops a mind of its own and wreaks havoc, speeding and swerving into traffic. Tom and his friends trap the car, and Tom stops the car before it runs over a pedestrian.
| Aux3 = 7:08
