| ShortSummary    = The friends, along with the yeti, make slime, when the yeti ruins his by accident. Ben gives his slime and adds a drop of a chemical that makes it extra-slimey, when a mugful of it touches Hank's slime. The slime turns into a candy-loving monster that causes chaos in the city. The friends successfully stop the monster with the yeti's help.Note: The total duration includes that of episodes 02 and 05
| Aux3 = 16:27
