| ShortSummary    = Hank steals his friends' food to make a sandwich, to his friends' annoyance, and refuses to share the sandwich. Meanwhile, a disposed off vacuum cleaner develops a mind of its own and a taste for food. When it finds Hank and begs for his sandwich, Hank refuses to share, and the vacuum sucks him in and leaves to steal food from others. The friends rescue Hank and shut down the vacuum cleaner, but Hank accidentally turns it back on when trying to take back his sandwich. The friends try to stop the vacuum, which by now has become a big monster, and Hank stops it by offering it food, and the vacuum peacefully leaves.Note: The total duration includes that of episodes 03 and 08
|Aux3 = 17:56
|Aux4 =
| LineColor       = 0D9BFF
