| ShortSummary    = A cotton candy vendor, who considers his customers to be money, run out of cotton candy. So, he goes to the factory and speeds up the machinery. When the machinery goes out of control, it initially starts snowing cotton candy, but soon, tornadoes made of it ensue. The friends reach the factory to stop the machinery, get the vacuum cleaner from the previous episode to vacuum up the mess and make the vendor give his cotton candy for free instead as punishment.Note: The total duration includes that of episodes 04 and 09
|Aux3 = 18:18
|Aux4 =
| LineColor       = 0D9BFF
