| ShortSummary    = The friends suffer in summer while Ben repairs their air conditioner. Meanwhile, the Raccoon Robber steals people's fans and air conditioners for himself. When he experiences a blackout, he redirects power from the power station so that no one else gets electricity. The gang fights the Raccoon to stop him and destroys his computer with which he commits all his crimes.Note: The total duration includes that of episodes 08 and 02
|Aux3 = 17:00
|Aux4 =
| LineColor       = 0D9BFF
