| ShortSummary    = Hank participates in an eating contest, in which he is in last place. All other competitors lose after collapsing, except for one. Spurred on by his friends, Hank wins at the last moment, infuriating his opponent, who starts demanding everyone's food. Hank challenges him to another contest, while his friends make him drink a can full of chilli sauce, giving him a bad case of diarrhoea.Note: The total duration includes that of episodes 09 and 01
|Aux3 = 16:29
|Aux4 =
| LineColor       = 0D9BFF
