| ShortSummary    = Hank and another farmer are competing in a pumpkin growing contest, when the farmer destroys all of Hank's pumpkins, but misses one. Hank finds out and installs security, and tends to his plant while the farmer uses too much fertiliser at a single spot. A giant pumpkin starts to kill all nearby plants by sucking nutrients, and the friends kill it by plugging its veins. The next day, Hank wins the pumpkin contest, to the farmer's annoyance.Note: The total duration includes that of episodes 10 and 14
|Aux3 = 16:52
|Aux4 =
| LineColor       = 0D9BFF
