| ShortSummary    = Tom wins a jewelled box for Angela, which contains a doll wearing a necklace. Angela takes the necklace for herself, and the doll comes to life. It makes the house seem haunted and makes the toys come to life. Angela and her friends stop the doll and trap it, and get it destroyed by the Crystal Mentor.Note: The total duration includes that of episodes 05 and 16
|Aux3 = 16:47
|Aux4 =
| LineColor       = 0D9BFF
