| ShortSummary    = At the circus, Ginger cheers for a clown who tries to perform well, while the rest of the audience heckles him. Depressed, he uses his invention to steal people's happiness and uses it on the audience while performing so as to be appreciated. Tom and the gang try to release the stolen happiness but get sprayed with it by the clown, when Ginger arrives and shows his tickets. The clown remembers how Ginger appreciated him, repents his mistake and releases the stolen happiness.Note: The total duration includes that of episodes 03 and 06
|Aux3 = 16:20
|Aux4 =
| LineColor       = 0D9BFF
}}
| ShortSummary    = Hank gets a toothache, so his friends take him to a dentist. However, Hank refuses to be treated, so Ben invents a shrinking device, and shrinks himself, Tom and Angela so that they can get rid of the naughty germs, while Ginger makes sure Hank doesn't hamper them while asleep. The friends get rid of the toothache, and force Hank to brush his teeth.Note: The total duration includes that of episodes 02 and 11
|Aux3 = 16:32
|Aux4 =
| LineColor       = 0D9BFF
