| ShortSummary    = After the friends misuse their powers to solve their personal problems, the Crystal Mentor takes them to a training ground, where Ginger is the coach. The friends reach the end of the course using their powers, so the Crystal Mentor takes their crystals away and sends them to the beginning. However, Ginger accidentally steps on a button, trapping himself above a pool infested with crocodiles. Tom, Angela, Ben and Hank then reach the end of the course and save Ginger without their powers, but fall in the pool. The Crystal Mentor then gets rid of the crocodiles, explains their wrongdoing and returns their crystals, much to their joy.Note: The total duration includes that of episodes 23 and 18
|Aux3 = 16:47
|Aux4 =
| LineColor       = 0D9BFF
