| ShortSummary    = Hank's power crystal gets broken when the friends save a child from a malfunctioning lift. later, he tries to use it to return to the heroes' headquarters, but instead ends up in a different place, and uses it again and again to escape from danger in each place until he reaches a jungle inhabited by a tribe of live pineapples. His friends find him being treated as the king of the tribe (as he gifted them with the contents of his bag) and bring Hank and his bag back safely by distracting the tribe, and get it fixed. Hank then goes back to the tribe to recover the fruits he was gifted with.Note: The total duration includes that of episodes 28, 25, 29, 18 and 31
|Aux3 = 31:09
|Aux4 =
|LineColor        = 0D9BFF
