| ShortSummary    = Ginger daydreams of being a superhero like his friends, when they leave. Then Ginger goes to Ben's house and finds Ben's pencil and board from Episode 1 that could create anything that is drawn on it, and uses it to make a power crystal of his own. Then he uses it to go to his friends' hero headquarters, and gets a new hero costume elevator of his own. However, he tries to use his powers, inadvertently damaging the hero headquarters, when Tom, Angela, Hank, and Ben return and see what happened. Ginger leaves in shame, and later disposes off his crystal. Meanwhile, the friends use their powers to fix the hero headquarters, and leave to fight a garbage-spewing monster. Ginger notices his power crystal glowing and uses it again, and attacks the monster while his friends have been defeated, but the garbage monster breaks Ginger's hoverboard. Ginger then uses Ben's device to draw elephants that destroy the monster with water., Ben fixes his hoverboard with his magnetic glove. Ginger becomes happy.
|Aux3 = 31:09
|Aux4 =
|LineColor        = 0D9BFF
